2026-06-29 14:41:58,649 | AGENT | AIInnovation Agent answered: Our company Faber IA has capabilities that align with the tender's requirements. We can leverage our Retrieval-augmented generation (RAG) approach, which is grounded in the organization's own validated documents. This ensures answers are supported by relevant passages from internal procedures, care protocols, and applicable regulatory texts.

To meet the information retrieval needs, we can utilize our hybrid retrieval capabilities, combining lexical and semantic search to quickly access reliable and up-to-date information. For drafting medical documents, our template-guided drafting capability can assist with discharge summaries, medical correspondence, and administrative documents.

