To ensure a high level of answer relevance, we measure answer quality using a labeled evaluation set built with the client, focusing on groundedness, relevance, and factual support. Our iterative approach includes corpus selection and curation, retrieval tuning, prompt and template design per use case, and an evaluation loop to continuously improve performance.

